---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact"
  description="If you wish to discuss a problem or make an appointment, please do get in touch with me on 07871 836785"
>
  <meta slot="head" name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
  <div class="main-article">
    <h3>How do I book an osteopathic appointment with you?</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>Book online <a target="_blank" style="color: black; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://booking.setmore.com/scheduleappointment/eee6e26f-97d1-405b-9ec0-1b5009d370aa">here</a> or via the "Book now" button in the menu above.</li>
      <li>You can call me on <b>+44 (0) 7871 836785</b> </li>
      <li>You can email me at <a style="color: black; text-decoration: underline;" href="mailto:jonedisosteopath@gmail.com">jonedisosteopath@gmail.com</a> </li>
      <li>You can even get in touch with me via my social media accounts. </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>When are you available?</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>My clinic hours are <b>Monday, 08:30-12:30</b></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Where are you?</h3>
    <img class="royal-hill" src="/images/royal-hill.jpg">
    <ul>
      <li>My address is:<br><br>
        Linear House<br>
        Peyton Place<br>
        Greenwich<br>
        London<br>
        SE10 8RS<br><br>
        <a class="link-on-white" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Linear+House%2C+Peyton+Place%2C+Greenwich%2C+London+SE10+8RS" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on Google Maps</a><br><br>
      </li>
      <li>It's a <b>5-minute walk</b> from <b>Greenwich Station</b> (served by National Rail & the DLR),
        Greenwich Park & the centre of Greenwich.<br><br></li>
        <li>The nearest <b>bus stop</b> is on <b>Greenwich High Road</b> (A206), served by
          the 129, 199 & 386 buses. <br><br></li>
          <li>If travelling by car, limited street parking is available on Peyton Place; street parking is also available on nearby streets.
            Please check whether charges, restrictions or residents' parking applies. <br><br></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>How much does an osteopathic consultation with you cost? </h3>
    <ul>
      <li>New patient sessions cost £80.<br><br></li>
      <li>Follow up or returning patient sessions are £70 per session. <br><br></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>How can I pay?</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>I accept cash, cheque, all major bank & credit cards, Google Pay & Apple Pay<br><br></li>
      <li>I do not accept Samsung Pay<br><br></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Can I use my private health insurance? </h3>
    <ul>
      <li>I am not registered with any health insurance providers.<br><br></li>
      <li>A receipt can be provided on request for you to claim back from your provider. <br><br></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Location: <a class="link-on-white" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Linear+House%2C+Peyton+Place%2C+Greenwich%2C+London+SE10+8RS" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Linear House, Peyton Place, Greenwich, London. SE10 8RS</a></p>
    <p>Phone: +44 (0)7871 836785</p>
    <p>
      Email: <a class="link-on-white" href="mailto:jonedisosteopath@gmail.com">jonedisosteopath@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
